        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prepare for battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft tactics, mix gear, and unlock endless possibilities.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/extras/771cd32ffc819fe9464f604018767bd4.avif?t=1778434831\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/extras_big/771cd32ffc819fe9464f604018767bd4.avif?t=1778434831 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/extras/def54bc24c450f8b339d1f46818d0120.avif?t=1778434831\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/extras_big/def54bc24c450f8b339d1f46818d0120.avif?t=1778434831 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aid the vulnerable kingdom soldiers and uncover the source of the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/extras/8ccc02053c088b41ba4beb9f53b87f6f.avif?t=1778434831\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/extras_big/8ccc02053c088b41ba4beb9f53b87f6f.avif?t=1778434831 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/extras/7387f4033ed3f11bcd3b1987220b804c.avif?t=1778434831\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/extras_big/7387f4033ed3f11bcd3b1987220b804c.avif?t=1778434831 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenging the Impossible</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're the last bit of courage left</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/extras/351e18757ecf8f659012c23fd4f55221.avif?t=1778434831\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/extras_big/351e18757ecf8f659012c23fd4f55221.avif?t=1778434831 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/extras/da0e8bbcd9f81a1c04b3fe9c201c0ff6.avif?t=1778434831\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/extras_big/da0e8bbcd9f81a1c04b3fe9c201c0ff6.avif?t=1778434831 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement</strong>: Use keyboard keys WASD or left mouse button.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attack</strong>: Right mouse button.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory</strong>: Press B to open the inventory. Right-click on equipment to wear it. Right-click on an already equipped slot to remove the item.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discard Items</strong>: Drag items outside the window to discard them. Discarded items cannot be recovered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skills</strong>: After learning a skill, press J to open the skills interface. Click and drag skill icons into the skill bar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Using Skills</strong>: Press the corresponding number key on the keyboard to select a skill, then use the right mouse button to activate it. Press the same number key again to switch back to normal attacks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional Notes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a maximum level of 30, with five main chapters and one hidden ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment with the 【Mimic】 tag can only be equipped once. It grants a stat boost multiplied by the player’s current level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After defeat, selecting &quot;LAST RECORD&quot; allows you to retain items and status changes, while selecting &quot;BACK TO LOGIN&quot; logs you out and returns you to the last save point.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the main city, there is a &quot;Chamber of Teleportation&quot; that allows travel to villages where teleportation has been unlocked. To unlock teleportation to a village, speak with the NPC in that village.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to contact the author at: <a href=\"mailto:331818250@qq.com\">331818250@qq.com</a>. Let’s work together to make the game even better!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prepare for battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft tactics, mix gear, and unlock endless possibilities.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/extras/771cd32ffc819fe9464f604018767bd4.avif?t=1778434831\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/extras_big/771cd32ffc819fe9464f604018767bd4.avif?t=1778434831 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/extras/def54bc24c450f8b339d1f46818d0120.avif?t=1778434831\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/extras_big/def54bc24c450f8b339d1f46818d0120.avif?t=1778434831 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aid the vulnerable kingdom soldiers and uncover the source of the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/extras/8ccc02053c088b41ba4beb9f53b87f6f.avif?t=1778434831\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/extras_big/8ccc02053c088b41ba4beb9f53b87f6f.avif?t=1778434831 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/extras/7387f4033ed3f11bcd3b1987220b804c.avif?t=1778434831\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/extras_big/7387f4033ed3f11bcd3b1987220b804c.avif?t=1778434831 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenging the Impossible</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're the last bit of courage left</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/extras/351e18757ecf8f659012c23fd4f55221.avif?t=1778434831\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/extras_big/351e18757ecf8f659012c23fd4f55221.avif?t=1778434831 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/extras/da0e8bbcd9f81a1c04b3fe9c201c0ff6.avif?t=1778434831\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/extras_big/da0e8bbcd9f81a1c04b3fe9c201c0ff6.avif?t=1778434831 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement</strong>: Use keyboard keys WASD or left mouse button.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attack</strong>: Right mouse button.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory</strong>: Press B to open the inventory. Right-click on equipment to wear it. Right-click on an already equipped slot to remove the item.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discard Items</strong>: Drag items outside the window to discard them. Discarded items cannot be recovered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skills</strong>: After learning a skill, press J to open the skills interface. Click and drag skill icons into the skill bar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Using Skills</strong>: Press the corresponding number key on the keyboard to select a skill, then use the right mouse button to activate it. Press the same number key again to switch back to normal attacks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional Notes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a maximum level of 30, with five main chapters and one hidden ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment with the 【Mimic】 tag can only be equipped once. It grants a stat boost multiplied by the player’s current level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After defeat, selecting &quot;LAST RECORD&quot; allows you to retain items and status changes, while selecting &quot;BACK TO LOGIN&quot; logs you out and returns you to the last save point.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the main city, there is a &quot;Chamber of Teleportation&quot; that allows travel to villages where teleportation has been unlocked. To unlock teleportation to a village, speak with the NPC in that village.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to contact the author at: <a href=\"mailto:331818250@qq.com\">331818250@qq.com</a>. Let’s work together to make the game even better!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
        "short_description": "The Legend of Fatinha is a gift for my wife and child, made in spare time. No AI – art, code, music almost all by me. This medieval world holds my love for family, classic RPGs, and words to share. Hope you love Ruby's story – she means the most. May this gift bring you a warm, fantastic adventure.",
